      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_12322841_0570&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_12322841_0570.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_12323577_0571&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_12323577_0571.jpg&#34;&gt;From: Maud G., To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
116 Spaulding Pl.&lt;br&gt;
Jacksonville, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Bess –&lt;br&gt;
How have you been making it this week. We are sure going out Sunday night. Alice and Hreenham are going with us. Won’t it he dandy. I had a long talk with Mr. Ehnie before anyone got to see him.&lt;br&gt;
Maud G.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
